02:45:04.140 --> 02:45:08.040
with some of these other type 2A antagonists.
Dr. Matt Walker: I think it's a good question.&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:45:08.040 --> 02:45:15.120
I don't think we really know what percentage&nbsp;
strength of pushback on each one of those three&nbsp;&nbsp;

