02:46:19.020 --> 02:46:24.600
and serotonin unchanged and block histamine. And&nbsp;
that way, I could create this rank ordering effect&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:46:24.600 --> 02:46:31.320
of the impact of trazodone on each of those three&nbsp;
systems. I at least don't know of evidence that&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:46:31.319 --> 02:46:37.259
has systematically done that to disentangle&nbsp;
